{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1053_040tam", "source_sha256": "60bbded7265b22dc83d6151dfac21adcf0c038adefa266d425534bc79b2cfc20", "ja": "ホント！？\nみんなも、ハイホー隊楽しい？", "zh": "真的！？\n大家也觉得哈伊霍小队很开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
