{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1084_040tam", "source_sha256": "ac66624f0d3322e4624e0202e08f955c2b7b46a2adea4989c4362e20e2b7be85", "ja": "ばあちゃんのところに行きたい……。\nばあちゃんに会いたい……。", "zh": "我想去奶奶那里……  \n我想见奶奶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1085_040tam", "source_sha256": "b154201ed406bb5cadf07492b8eebc223649027ab1b8aace387a89fa3bab2b78", "ja": "ばあちゃん……うぅ……。", "zh": "奶奶……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1086_p", "source_sha256": "b83cf6bc0c61c26a9671beeda2a049b5c76958dfd5ccef666638528ad8eda28c", "ja": "今、お父さんがおばあさんのところに向かっている\nそうだ。また連絡してくれるって言ってたけど……。", "zh": "听说爸爸现在正在赶往奶奶那里。他说之后还会再联系……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1088_p", "source_sha256": "09ff6fad5d53bb09b5a639d1a974f4d3262de436bb2cc53e519147324de9c7e8", "ja": "……なあ、環。\n新曲のお披露目は、延期するか？", "zh": "……那个，环。\n新歌的首次亮相，要延期吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1089_040tam", "source_sha256": "00f5d43ae65dbede2ccde92fd670cff9264a333c2f2ce0268170e36232b43e38", "ja": "え！？　な、なんで……？", "zh": "诶！？为、为什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1090_p", "source_sha256": "0619c7762f939fc203e3ad6e34acab402b6e00f09680ddba1784fc604f30144f", "ja": "なんで……と言われると答え辛いんだけど。\n今の環を公演に出すのは、少し心配だしな……。", "zh": "要是问我为什么……我也有点难回答。\n让现在的环参加公演，我有些担心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1091_p", "source_sha256": "8762b15b1819a3f1ec9b1f99b63091e904f22f87ebd963b8a7e9c0ff51b3675f", "ja": "それに公演を延期すれば、環のおばあさんも\n観に来られるかもしれないだろ？", "zh": "而且，如果延期公演的话，说不定环的奶奶也能来看吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1092_040tam", "source_sha256": "424287860917b21f23148f250eb19e55900d98b2380c7d41237eae8bf0f98b7f", "ja": "でも……でも！　たまき、ばあちゃんと約束した！\nステージ、がんばるって！", "zh": "可是……可是！环和奶奶约好了！一定要努力登上舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1093_p", "source_sha256": "05c1140f864661508c6b018576dca7a76a4add7392a89b5740c1881b87e2a714", "ja": "環……。", "zh": "环……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1094_se", "source_sha256": "8ab39c98b354b4c90079a04be042a686ff82e33ef4d4f826dadeab546caa166a", "ja": "ヴーッ、ヴーッ！", "zh": "呜——，呜——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1095_p", "source_sha256": "4fc4d09fb2e3d5ed6ec5903600266b5ad8997efb4bbde81a0165e1363b6a44d1", "ja": "ん、俺じゃないな……\n環のスマホか？", "zh": "嗯，不是我的啊……\n是环的手机吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1096_040tam", "source_sha256": "5fc2735c69d9b130494c628d3879e88f45aa62d1c0865ce949e40da1d998d46d", "ja": "え……ああっ、ばあちゃん！？\nもしもし、ばあちゃん！？", "zh": "诶……啊，是奶奶！？  \n喂喂，奶奶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1097_tamakisobo", "source_sha256": "aaf75c36c62e9307504644d215be7a1dc6c144879d365cac80d277536239d685", "ja": "「はいはい、ばあちゃんよ。環が慌てとるんじゃ\nないかと思って電話したけど、やっぱりねえ」", "zh": "「好啦好啦，是奶奶哦。我就想着环是不是正慌张着\n呢才打了电话过来，果然是这样啊」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1098_tamakisobo", "source_sha256": "8241fd423d84222eda62be378ac3a1f1dc0da59498fceb0b54d3583dabd87930", "ja": "「環、ばあちゃん大丈夫だから心配しなくていいんよ。\nちょっと足を捻っただけなのに、みんな大げさでねえ」", "zh": "「环，奶奶没事，你不用担心的。\n只是稍微扭到了脚，大家也太小题大做了」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1099_040tam", "source_sha256": "4f16d8609baa87e35863806554fc1c611f8f05b8e124d8cbd650192a33bba979", "ja": "ばあちゃん……でも、でも……！", "zh": "奶奶……可是，可是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1100_tamakisobo", "source_sha256": "fe431e4689c8e5de6f19faf8386626097d9458bfeb62019a1ca96302e1e2c051", "ja": "「本当に大丈夫。それより、環が元気を\nなくしてないかって、そっちのほうが心配なんよ」", "zh": "「真的没事啦。比起这个，我更担心\n环会不会提不起精神呢」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1101_tamakisobo", "source_sha256": "a22d478a01a29ab807f74d06f4161d5b4d77e3e5ea053e221bc1a06e487688ee", "ja": "「帰ってきてほしい時は、ちゃんと連絡するから。\nだから環は、大事なお仕事、がんばんなさい」", "zh": "“等希望你回来的时候，我会好好联络你的。\n所以环，你要把重要的工作好好做好哦”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1102_040tam", "source_sha256": "45440caf3ae783aa4b2ee5ca5cc741679c6dcc7e9b9f125e2309c7cc5fc223cc", "ja": "ばあちゃん……。", "zh": "奶奶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1103_tamakisobo", "source_sha256": "7aa949ee0098959ab261d3813dc6168d412d365ea8defa814e50175431768ad7", "ja": "「それじゃ、またね」", "zh": "「那么，下次见」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1105_p", "source_sha256": "cc1099224dadb88ff62eb464d9a36b728704446742ef4f9e6f8ec4e564fb2c65", "ja": "環、大丈夫か？\nおばあさん、何だって？", "zh": "环，没事吧？\n老奶奶说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1106_040tam", "source_sha256": "554ca975bf58133dd4ce61b6a7954e5286e2b1e74c9e6478a4cf58fb2f91fed0", "ja": "足をひねっただけだから、大丈夫だって……。", "zh": "她说只是扭到了脚，没关系……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1107_040tam", "source_sha256": "f8bd851b8ce52ad550fe0c7a92cf049d5f1c953cddbf58dbab49a6a84aad5ef8", "ja": "たまきが元気をなくしてないか、心配だって……。", "zh": "说是担心环会不会没精神……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1108_040tam", "source_sha256": "dd968a38db0afe9ab8dde49172eb83a2d1f4cb7304bd0d9864f55a7c807f3477", "ja": "大事なお仕事……がんばんなさいって……。", "zh": "重要工作……要好好加油……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1109_p", "source_sha256": "a41c820a236baaf295d1b91574afbde458642d2052c4776a35f29de497abc270", "ja": "そうか。……よし、わかった！\n環、やれそうか？", "zh": "这样啊……好，我明白了！  \n环，你能做到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1110_040tam", "source_sha256": "716d0e400def1172a47889cb83f63b1dafc80ba4af3588239d1e632aad9ba10a", "ja": "ぐすっ……うん、おやぶん！\nたまき、新曲歌う！", "zh": "抽泣……嗯，老大！环要唱新歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1111_040tam", "source_sha256": "5898efda3192a4528714c14db8316b244f29647b503efe2bdf76117b5c7d0a80", "ja": "たまきの歌で、みんなをいっぱい元気にする！\nばあちゃんと約束したから！", "zh": "我要用环的歌，让大家都打起精神来！\n因为这是和奶奶约定好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1112_040tam", "source_sha256": "ad065bf3d158b5457c66854e83c799c2a6cd12c66e2b1f335fc4be2dfa782b34", "ja": "だからおやぶん、たまきをステージに立たせて！\nお願い！", "zh": "所以大亲，让小环站上舞台吧！\n拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_132_1113_p", "source_sha256": "da8215829ec8101255b4b4dc21a949005435aca211a04f09af4dde1b90b42527", "ja": "むしろ、お願いするのはこっちだよ。\n……公演、みんなで頑張ろうな！　環！", "zh": "倒不如说，该拜托你的是我才对。\n……演出的时候，大家一起加油吧！环！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
